    {
      "source": "Provides an opportunity to initialize the <code>TcpClient</code> for the given\n<a href=\"../TcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp\"><code>TcpConnectionHandler</code></a> which may implement sub-interfaces such as\n<a href=\"../../simp/stomp/StompTcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompTcpConnectionHandler</code></a>\nthat expose further information.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"../TcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp\"><code>TcpConnectionHandler</code></a> 提供初始化其 <code>TcpClient</code> 的机会，该处理器可能实现诸如 <a href=\"../../simp/stomp/StompTcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompTcpConnectionHandler</code></a> 等子接口，这些子接口会暴露更多信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../simp/stomp/StompSession.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompSession</code></a> that implements\n<a href=\"../TcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp\"><code>TcpConnectionHandler</code></a> in order to send and receive messages.",
      "translation": "一个实现了 <a href=\"../TcpConnectionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.tcp\"><code>TcpConnectionHandler</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../../simp/stomp/StompSession.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompSession</code></a>，用于发送和接收消息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
